msgstr "Опаковки (включително разделно събирани битови отпадъци от опаковки)"

#. module: l10n_bg_waste_base
#: model:l10n.bg.waste.code,name:l10n_bg_waste_base.waste_code_16_01
msgid ""
"End-of-life vehicles from different means of transport (including off-road "
"machinery) and wastes from dismantling of end-of-life vehicles and vehicle "
